Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:55.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators, stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't escape me !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly's cultivation is too high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and she displays such a strong killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must also attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:45.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268,488)\fad(300,000)}Wang Lin's\NRestriction Spear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:49.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu's is Early stage Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,how can he display such strength !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you didn't send your parents off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are unfilial !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,He actually knows how to break her Dao Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,For one selfish desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,you destroyed the Four Sect Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are heartless !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You tried to kill me without any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is unjust !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xue Yue still exists
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet you sold yourself to Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are unfaithful !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are unfilial, unjust, and unfaithful !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of Dao are you cultivating ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even when all the stars align,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still can't even touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are the first one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,who forced me to use my life artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can rest in peace now !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was the one who invited you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you both continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,then don't blame me for being ruthless !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who started all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back down !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,both of you are my guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you insist on continuing to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,then that means you’re hostile towards me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will stand with Brother Ceng and fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if I make it back alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:59.52,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(265,495)\fad(300,300)}Chi Hu's\NOrigin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely report this to Xi Zu !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Divine Retribution !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the sake of our relation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t kill this person today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the celestial jade coffin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I can't kill you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only need to send out this restriction in my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this fragment will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you believe me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:44.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll make the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything we obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be split equally between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I leave it to Brother Chi Hu then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,when we return to planet Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you dare to fight me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ting'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,look,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:23.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1649,436)\fad(300,000)}Ting'er
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has been 1000 years
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you are still so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your body was preserved
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to the celestial jades I gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You kept your beautiful appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely find
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,more celestial jades for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,People say I'm a crazy, disgusting,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,corpse-loving maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it is fate that I met you in the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who cares if they say I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your husband will always protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anyone that opposes us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.53,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1677,449)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Jade Pagoda
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Red Butterfly's ice sculpture really is amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the coldest of the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:28.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1700,469)\fad(300,300)}Central Cold Fragment\NRain Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without fellow cultivator Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,we couldn't have crossed those lands of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if it is beyond this obstacle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,why hasn't anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,found the location in the jade ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the reason I'm so confident
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,is because that fragment cannot be accessed through the vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a very rare case of fragments overlapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even teleportation formations are useless there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:57.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did Xi Zu find it back then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:08:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This involves my clan's secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can’t tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,After traversing this cold fragment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will have to go through the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the void,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will reach the overlapping fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have done my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the end of the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,My spiritual energy has ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't act anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can count on us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have spent a lot of spiritual energy these past 3 days
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if she ran out of spiritual energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:43.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,she can just take a pill to recover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:46.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,She clearly is luring me into attacking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could reach Middle stage Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,my domain would evolve
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:53.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I would be able to defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 years to Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,she might be a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but her cultivation must be unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Giant Demon Clan's treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the star compass ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:10.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1680,419)\fad(300,300)}Fake Star Compass
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Tu Si's memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have the method to craft such a star compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pity most of the materials are extinct
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's almost impossible to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it were a real star compass,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would not be able to control it with my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one is just an imitation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's not as effective as a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.20,0:09:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,please go to the west side of the compass, under the defensive barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way you can safely recover your spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise you that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,nothing will bother you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,during this trip through the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need you to control the eastern side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this void,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are many unknown entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to use those souls of yours to scout
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and if you encounter anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,tell me so I can avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this void,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must not spread your Divine Sense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:05.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,because doing so will bring about disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is something
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Xi Zu told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,this compass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,is meant to be operated
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,by at least 5 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Correct !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there aren't enough treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to divide between 5 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,if this compass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,breaks in the void,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,none of us will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must focus all of my attention on controlling the compass
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it will all depend on Brother Ceng.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:56.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1616,486)}Void\NRain Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's something 10 li ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up ! Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Brother Ceng for the early warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the three of us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,, would have died there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of beast was that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,but something that can live inside the void of the Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not something we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast is called Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Xu is considered a minor destructive beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is born from devouring the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1665,443)\fad(300,300)}Xu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and lives by feeding off Yin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even during ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the ancient cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:08.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,would need many people
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng is really knowledgeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:15.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who knows if what he said is real ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't make up a random name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast only spreads its tentacles
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,when it's looking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,When this beast hunts,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,it spreads out a red aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not something we can resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,quickly fly north !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we got further north,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will be even more lost in the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.89,0:12:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't believe him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we continue north here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,our future will be uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to talk about this !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:53.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine that he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:57.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that he recognized that creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng was right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Had I listened to Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,this wouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go faster !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly, do something !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The lost petals
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,can be recovered via cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I only have 5 stamens...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will never be able to get it back !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,sit down so we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know I was wrong before,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I apologize for my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else the beast will do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can we choose our direction after this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since we've escaped the red aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,there shouldn’t be any issues for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chi Hu should follow the map
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and try to get back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:55.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:14:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The star compass has been damaged...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It won't last long in this condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to completely rely on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,504)\fad(300,300)}10 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've been through a lot in the past 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Ceng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have also gained a lot from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,our discussions about the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Giant Demon Clan isn't native to planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,My ancestors moved there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,thousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's natural that our techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.40,0:15:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,are somewhat different.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:50.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1615,432)\fad(300,000)}Golden Purple Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.29,0:15:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This stone is used to refine star compasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In order to leave planet Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will need my own star compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1630,517)\fad(300,000)}Void near the first layer of\Nthe overlapping fragments\NRain Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were waiting on the star compass for you to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it began to shake violently
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a strong force threw us off of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Tu Si's memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a way to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The star compass is badly damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's unusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It cannot help us fly anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The three of us will have to rely on ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 3 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should arrive at the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I feel like we are being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,504)\fad(900,900)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:16:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xi Zu once described the first layer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:05.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,since the location on the jade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems to be on another layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,which layer is it on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useless question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course it's on the second layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is already very unlikely for fragments to overlap once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:23.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's on the second layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my ancestor Xi Zu once speculated
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there might be a third layer below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's move, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ting'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be more celestial jades on the third layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1631,500)\fad(300,000)}Second layer of the\Noverlapping fragments\NRain Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was Xi Zu mistaken ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are the coffin and the celestial swords ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could they have vanished ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this the place you were talking about ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don’t give me a proper explanation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let this go !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chi Hu doesn't seem to be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of arguing, why don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we do something ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You two,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was too reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,You were reckless ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:43.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will saying that help me recover my lost stamen !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't explain yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,then don’t blame me for not caring about our clans’ relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once we return to planet Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.37,0:18:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a proper explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Chi Hu, am the young master of the Giant Demon Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although I can’t match you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:18:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Chi Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,you said before that there might be a third layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have found the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five Elements Sect's Zhou Yi ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:53.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:59.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:03.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:07.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}and like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:13.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:20.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:26.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:30.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:34.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:40.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:44.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:48.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:54.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:58.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:02.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:08.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:12.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:16.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:21.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:25.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:29.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:35.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:42.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:49.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:55.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:22:02.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
